          },
          {
            "name": "description",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "When this policy setting is enabled,  the operating system generates audit events when a process is created (starts) and the name of the program or user that created it.\n\nThese audit events can help with understanding how a computer is being used and tracking user activity."
          }
